SUMMARY:Figure Drawing at the Rose Garden in Brookdale Park
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, August 29\, 4 – 6 pm\, by donation \nIt’s summer and we want to draw outside!  Let’s enjoy some fresh air\, take in the beauty of the outdoors\, and connect with nature and each other by drawing together in the park. This is intended to be a relaxed summer social event that is open to all. \nThis session will have a clothed model\, so the donations will help cover that cost. \nBring your supplies and something to sit on.  Drinks and snacks are highly encouraged for casual and social late afternoon get together. \nAll skill levels welcome. \nSaturday\, August 29 | 4:00 – 6:00 pm at the Rose Garden in Brookdale Park\, Montclair  \n \n \nCheck out our regular weekly Tuesday night sessions here. \nAnd our Sunday long pose sessions here.
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/figure-drawing-in-brookdale-park/
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thespaceforart.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Screenshot-2026-08-14-at-10.22.33-PM.png
END:VEVENT
