SUMMARY:Sonic Healing Experience with Taylor Grant
DESCRIPTION:Sonic Sound Healing Experience with Taylor Grant\nSaturday\, September 26 · 7:00 – 8:30 PM \nJoin us for a sonic healing journey with local DJ Taylor Grant\, who blends crystal bowls with intentionally chosen tracks to restore the body to resonance. Picture the lights dimmed low\, the room falling away\, and nothing left but sound — waves of tone rippling across your skin\, low frequencies humming in your chest\, crystal bowls ringing out long after they’ve been struck. Taylor curates sound journeys of all kinds\, and this one is designed to let you fully rest: a ride through nostalgia\, exploration\, and fantasia\, carried by tone and texture rather than words. \nWe’re timing this with the full moon\, harnessing that energy as part of the experience. In sound healing traditions\, the full moon marks the peak of the lunar cycle — the moment everything you’ve been carrying rises to the surface and is ready to be released. It’s a night for letting go of what’s grown stagnant\, for clarity to surface\, for whatever you’ve been holding onto to finally move. The bowls and tones do the work of loosening it; the moon does the work of amplifying it. \nYou’ll spend the evening lying on the floor\, eyes closed\, letting the sound wash over and through you — no tension\, no talking\, just full-body immersion in the wave\, released a little further with every tone. \nCome with an open mind. Bring a yoga mat (or something soft to lie on) and a water bottle to stay hydrated — sound baths can pull you deep\, and you’ll want to come back out nourished. Beyond that\, you have nowhere else to be but to be! \nPlease arrive before 7\, and give yourself enough time to park.
URL:https://thespaceforart.com/event/sonic-healing-experience-with-taylor-grant/
